{"at": "2026-07-05T22:13:53Z", "commit_ref": "none", "intent": "spec", "actor": "agent", "kind": "output", "content": "Authored the full spec 0033 from the preliminary spec C:/GitHub/Berreman/specs/0027/.manual/035-materials-samples-library-preliminary-spec.md (rev. 4, incl. the 036/037 dispersion refinements): steering .spec-md (binding constraints, contract table, parts A-G orientation) + 26-step .spec-jsonl. Part A (CRITICAL): structural SampleStructure/PeriodGroup replaces the sampleToSystem string-id branching (Propagation.fs:139-141) and the glass fallback; MaterialId/SampleId elevate to Guid-backed DUs; mutating MaterialProxy/SampleProxy contracts (<STORE:MaterialProxy>, <STORE:SampleProxy>) with stateful in-memory createInMemory and the removeMaterial hard-block. Part B: serializable ...Value dispersion types in Berreman/Dispersion.fs (WaveLengthInterval/DispersionFormula, descriptive ConstantEpsValue, EpsAxisDispersion, 3 segment flavors, EpsWithDispValue/RhoWithDispValue/MuWithDispValue building the unchanged non-serializable *WithDisp funcs); GyrationClass symmetry-driven rho with new 222/monoclinic/triclinic builders in Active.fs; DispersionModels lowering via toEpsAxis + ForouhiBloomer/BrendelBormann/SumOfTerms; AnisotropicModel removed; MaterialComplexity option tree + MaterialEntry.complexity. Part C: Selector rename + domain-free MaterialsControls/SampleLibraryControls (<UICOMP:...>) + host wiring. Part D: real-move of ExperimentChart/ChartWindow into Controls + second Y axis + n-left/k-right dispersion chart. Part E: CrystalOrientation (builds Rotation, applied via Layer.rotate), pure Domain SampleStackEditor bulk/period ops, SampleEditorWindow. Part F: MaterialEditorWindow progressive complexity ladder. Part G: RII import formulas 2-7 (8/9 typed unsupported error). Final step WIRE_UI at the App composition root. Recorded deviations from the preliminary spec: bulk ops live in a new Domain SampleStackEditor (not StackEditor.StackMsg additions - Stack